<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1A2F', padding: '24px 64px', position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden', fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif" }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 620, height: 620, background: 'radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(34,211,238,0.16) 0%, rgba(34,211,238,0) 70%)' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, right: 0, width: 460, height: 460, background: 'radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, rgba(245,165,36,0.10) 0%, rgba(245,165,36,0) 70%)' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'relative', zIndex: 1, width: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 92, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, letterSpacing: 3, color: '#22D3EE' }}>01 / 问题与需求</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 700, color: '#E8F1FA', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>最痛的不是「堵」，是「干」</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, borderRadius: 23, border: '2px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.55)', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 700, color: '#22D3EE' }}>Q1</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 500, marginTop: 16, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 60, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '16px 20px', background: 'linear-gradient(150deg, #14294A 0%, #0E2039 100%)', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(139,166,193,0.22)' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600, color: '#B7CBDD', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>ENS6Q 六条目基线得分（0–5 分制，n = 53，多国在线招募）</Text>
                <Chart
                    style={{ height: 420, marginTop: 10 }}
                    chartType='barChart'
                    barDirection='bar'
                    showLegend={false}
                    showDataLabels={true}
                    axisColor='#8BA6C1'
                    dataLabelColor='#0A1A2F'
                    background='transparent'
                    colors={['linear-gradient(90deg, #22D3EE 0%, #7DE3F4 100%)']}
                    data={[
                        ['条目', '基线均分'],
                        ['干燥', 4.07],
                        ['气流感减弱', 4.02],
                        ['鼻腔过通', 3.74],
                        ['窒息感', 3.23],
                        ['灼热感', 2.77],
                        ['结痂', 2.74],
                    ]}
                />
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 40, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, letterSpacing: 2, color: '#22D3EE' }}>最痛的两项</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 16 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 76, fontWeight: 800, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1 }}>4.07</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#8BA6C1' }}>干燥</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 16 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 76, fontWeight: 800, color: '#F5A524', lineHeight: 1 }}>4.02</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#8BA6C1' }}>感觉不到气流</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: '18px 20px', background: 'rgba(245,165,36,0.08)', borderLeft: '3px solid #F5A524', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E8F1FA', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        干燥与气流感知是患者最痛的两项，却恰恰是现有<span style={{ color: '#F5A524', fontWeight: 600 }}>鼻腔填充类方案改善最弱</span>的一对——所以产品目标不能只定在「恢复通气」。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8BA6C1', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    出处：Manji J, et al. <span style={{ fontStyle: 'italic' }}>Ann Otol Rhinol Laryngol</span>. 2019（【实】L1 同行评议）。ENS6Q 满分 30，总分 ≥11 提示 ENS。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 42, marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid rgba(139,166,193,0.22)' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8BA6C1' }}>数据落点：产品的价值主张由「让鼻子通气」修正为「让黏膜重新被气流刺激」</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8BA6C1' }}>04 / 09</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
